# Secrets and credential-shaped paths — blocked from Agent / Tab / Inline Edit.
# Not a hard security boundary (terminal/MCP can still reach files). Prefer vaults.
# Index noise belongs in `.cursorindexingignore`, not here.

# Environment and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Credential / key material
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/*service-account*.json
**/*-sa.json

# Local auth / session dumps (if ever present)
**/.netrc
**/auth.json

